  "details": "Currently, if you're the type to take a lot of photos using the camera and then forget about them, you'll end up with a single enormous \"VRChat\" folder in Pictures. Scrolling through hundreds of images to find the one you want can be tedious, and it takes a long time to display everything for slower HDDs. ShareX saves everything into folders separated into different months, making it easier to search through, and I think it'd help if VRChat automatically did something similar.",
